        "detailed_description": "<strong>An eternal loop begins, where every new beginning is a challenge.</strong><br>Continuously grow stronger to survive in Eternal Rising, a rogue-lite bullet hell where relentless enemies block your path at every turn. Your only option is to keep moving forward, destroying anything that stands in your way. Death is inevitable — but with each new attempt, you evolve, becoming more powerful and better prepared to face the endless trials of eternal life.<br><br><strong>Battle through unique worlds in Eternal Rising</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/0d81a34d0914bbf8baa22bde122c2244.poster.avif?t=1772980188\" width=615 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/0d81a34d0914bbf8baa22bde122c2244.webm?t=1772980188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Collect experience orbs to unleash powerful attacks and crush your adversaries. Choose from a wide variety of weapons and finely-tuned upgrades to customize your build each run. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/a27768207c994daf9ce8bfb61c45f8a9.poster.avif?t=1772980188\" width=614 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/a27768207c994daf9ce8bfb61c45f8a9.webm?t=1772980188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/a27768207c994daf9ce8bfb61c45f8a9.mp4?t=1772980188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In Eternal Rising, the rules are simple: rise or fall. Use every tool at your disposal to overcome your enemies and carve your path to victory in this unforgiving rogue-lite adventure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/f3d1c6740a0a26a2341fb8a276b99166.poster.avif?t=1772980188\" width=614 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/f3d1c6740a0a26a2341fb8a276b99166.webm?t=1772980188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/f3d1c6740a0a26a2341fb8a276b99166.mp4?t=1772980188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Defeat the Guardian Boss to unlock the passage to the next realm. Prepare for epic confrontations and blaze your trail through the unknown, one victory at a time.",
        "about_the_game": "<strong>An eternal loop begins, where every new beginning is a challenge.</strong><br>Continuously grow stronger to survive in Eternal Rising, a rogue-lite bullet hell where relentless enemies block your path at every turn. Your only option is to keep moving forward, destroying anything that stands in your way. Death is inevitable — but with each new attempt, you evolve, becoming more powerful and better prepared to face the endless trials of eternal life.<br><br><strong>Battle through unique worlds in Eternal Rising</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/0d81a34d0914bbf8baa22bde122c2244.poster.avif?t=1772980188\" width=615 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/0d81a34d0914bbf8baa22bde122c2244.webm?t=1772980188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Collect experience orbs to unleash powerful attacks and crush your adversaries. Choose from a wide variety of weapons and finely-tuned upgrades to customize your build each run. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/a27768207c994daf9ce8bfb61c45f8a9.poster.avif?t=1772980188\" width=614 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/a27768207c994daf9ce8bfb61c45f8a9.webm?t=1772980188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/a27768207c994daf9ce8bfb61c45f8a9.mp4?t=1772980188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In Eternal Rising, the rules are simple: rise or fall. Use every tool at your disposal to overcome your enemies and carve your path to victory in this unforgiving rogue-lite adventure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/f3d1c6740a0a26a2341fb8a276b99166.poster.avif?t=1772980188\" width=614 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/f3d1c6740a0a26a2341fb8a276b99166.webm?t=1772980188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/f3d1c6740a0a26a2341fb8a276b99166.mp4?t=1772980188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Defeat the Guardian Boss to unlock the passage to the next realm. Prepare for epic confrontations and blaze your trail through the unknown, one victory at a time.",
